re built into the Horizon mobile application?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon employs a layered security framework that incorporates encryption, identity verification, fraud detection, and continuous real‑time monitoring to safeguard your account, transactions, and personal data.\\n- Access to the Horizon App is secured with multi‑factor authentication, and the app may be linked to only a single device and one phone number at any given time.\\n- Requiring two distinct authentication methods by default provides a robust defense against online threats.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON. The Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed9b5ce2\", \"content\": \"Question: What measures does Horizon Bank take to protect me from phishing scams and unauthorized transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security and adhere to the guidelines outlined in Section {{faq_ed9b5ce2_001}} of the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines. As part of our commitment to the Shared Responsibility Framework, we have implemented several key measures to safeguard your accounts. These include: \\n   - A mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device, during which certain high-risk activities such as adding new payees, increasing transaction limits, disabling notifications, or changing your contact information are restricted.\\n   - Immediate notifications: You will receive instant updates via push notifications and email for all outgoing payments, ensuring you are always informed about your transactions.\\n   - Emergency Lockdown: The Horizon App features an Emergency Lockdown option, accessible under Profile > Security, which allows you to instantly block all access to your mobile banking, account, and cards if you suspect they have been compromised.\\n   - Advanced Security Systems: As of {{faq_ed9b5ce2_003}} June {{faq_ed9b5ce2_004}}, we have enhanced our systems to provide an additional layer of protection against potential phishing scams. Some transactions may be temporarily paused for review, and you will be notified to verify the transaction. If you do not recognize the transaction, please cancel it within the {{faq_ed9b5ce2_005}}-hour timeframe provided.\\n   - Round-the-Clock Support: Our customer service is available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}}. You can reach us through the Horizon App or by calling our dedicated hotline at +{{faq_ed9b5ce2_008}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_009}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_010}} for immediate assistance.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_compo