{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T06:45:35.960+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_2c022427-3876-4f70-9bc8-6ac0bd8ab7b8", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): waht products can i use in the app?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: where can i download the horizaon app?\nAI: 📱 You can download the Horizon mobile app solely from the official Apple App Store for iOS devices or the Google Play Store for Android devices.\nUser: can i download it outside of Singapore?\nAI: 📱 I currently do not have any details available regarding whether the Horizon mobile app can be downloaded and used outside of Singapore.\nUser: what else do you know about the app?\nAI: 📱 The Horizon mobile application includes several built-in security features designed to protect your account, transactions, and personal data:\nA layered security framework that incorporates encryption, identity verification, fraud detection, and continuous real‑time monitoring.\nMulti‑factor authentication to secure app access, with the app linked to only a single device and one phone number at any given time.\nAn Emergency Lockdown option (accessible under Profile > Security) that allows you to instantly block all access to your mobile banking, account, and cards if you suspect