omer as well?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To open a new Horizon Bank account, you can simply use your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo to securely pre-fill your application. Opening a savings account does not automatically make you a credit card customer. Only Singapore citizens and permanent residents who meet specific age and annual income criteria can hold both a savings account and a credit card, and credit card applications can be submitted through **More > More for you** within the Horizon App.\\n\\nFor non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i see. how can i manage my profile info\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to apply for a loan?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank as a current client, you can open the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to begin. If you are not yet a customer, you can download the app first, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to start your application. 📱\"}]\n\n    Pending service requests carried over from before (label/topic only):\n    [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a