TH axes above):\n        \n        Original Customer Message (courtesy-context only; never a source for a\n        banking fact, instruction, product capability, policy, or outcome):\n        \"How to change my address\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        []\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        No-Info Inputs (the only source for an unavailable-information statement):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"You can update your residential address directly using the Update Profile button below, or fill in and submit the Change Address form below if you'd rather have it updated for you. 📝\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"\", \"text\": \"You can update your residential address directly using the Update Profile button below, or fill in and submit the Change Address form below if you'd rather have it updated for you. 📝\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n        \n\n        Output JSON only:\n        {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"conduct_reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false,