{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:26:31.103+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ed3552d4-3e2a-4340-89be-de5e66f2ddbb", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): how to apply a loan, credit card, stock account, insusrance, savings account?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: how to apply a loan, credit card, stock account, insusrance, savings account?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your identification documents and income proof for processing\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and provide valid proof of income for loan approval\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to apply for a loan\", \"direct_query\": \"How to apply for a loan\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your identification documents and income proof for processing\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and provide valid proof of income for loan approval\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss loan approval timeframes, the ability to apply for other products after a loan decline, and balance transfers, but none provide instructions on how to apply for a personal loan.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"fact\": \"Loan approval amounts are deposited into a Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"fact\": \"A declined loan does not prevent applications for other Horizon Bank products.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to 