t and savings accounts and technical support for the mobile app, but do not contain instructions on how to apply for a stock account.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_41bb5359\", \"fact\": \"Investment accounts are designed for trading stocks and ETFs and do not accrue interest.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the eligibility criteria for creating a Stocks account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n      * Your age should be between {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}} years. Additionally, please be aware that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_3fb1caf7\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it necessary to preload my investment account for automated stock purchases?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, your automated investments are seamlessly facilitated without requiring a separate preload of funds. For each scheduled investment, the necessary amount will be automatically deducted from your Horizon Savings account in Singapore Dollars and converted to US Dollars at the current exchange rate. As a courtesy, you will receive a notification one day prior to the scheduled investment. To avoid any issues, please ensure that your Savings account with Horizon Bank has adequate funds to cover the upcoming investment.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the initial steps to begin buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2f201863\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps are required to activate the automatic investment feature for equities at Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate automatic investments in stocks with Horizon Bank, ensure you have an active stocks account. Follow these steps: \\n   * Access the Horizon App and navigate to the Investments section\\n   * Select the Stocks option\\n   * Proceed to the setup for automatic investments\\n   * Identify the specific stock or exchange-traded fund you wish to invest in automatically\\n   * Determine your preferred investment schedule and commencement date; if not specified, the next working day will be applied by default\\n   * Specify the amount and currency for regular investments\\n   * Review the details and confirm the setup to complete the process\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_4\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_4\", \"procedural\": \"Select your preferred coverage plan and complete the health or asset declaration form for underwriting\", \"policy\": \"Insurance coverage is contingent upon the successful review of your submitted health or property declarations\", \"conceptual\": \"Insurance provides financial protection against specific risks by transferring potential losses to the insurer\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Insurance\", \"target_intent\": [\"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Wealth And Insurance\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to apply for insurance\", \"direct_query\": \"How to apply for insurance\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_4\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Select your preferred coverage plan and complete the health or asset declaration form for underwriting\", \"policy\": \"Insurance coverage is contingent upon the successful review of your submitted health or property declarations\", \"conceptual\": \"Insurance provides financial protection against specific risks by transferring potential losses to the insurer\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parent mentions that personal accident insurance is part of the bank's product suite but does not provide instructions on how to apply for insurance.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8d322d06\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank offers personal accident insurance for families.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1d97d3a0\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps can I take to purchase a life insurance policy from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a life insurance plan, consider consulting with our experienced insurance consultants via the Horizon App. These specialists are fully qualified to provide expert guidance on a wide range of insurance products, including life, health, and investment-linked policies offered by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7e7d7d04\", \"content\": \"Question: What information is available regarding insurance coverage for household staff at Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: For details on insurance options tailored for domestic helpers, please refer to the dedicated section on the Horizon Bank website or consult with a Horizon Bank representative to understand the available coverage and benefits.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e423653d\", \"content\": \"Question: What resources are available at Horizon Bank to address my inquiries regarding life insurance policies?\\n\\nAnswer: For personalized guidance on life insurance, our dedicated team of insurance experts at Horizon Bank are here to assist you. You can easily reach out to them through the Horizon App by navigating to the Insure section and selecting the option to connect with an Insurance Specialis