ue obligations with other financial institutions\\n- Absence of a recent Notice of Assessment or CPF contribution record\\n- Applicant is younger than {{faq_1b9ab045_008}} years old\\n\\nIf you were declined, you may still consider opening a Horizon savings account, which offers up to {{faq_1b9ab045_009}} p.a. on the first {{faq_1b9ab045_010}} deposited and can provide up to an {{faq_1b9ab045_011}} return when paired with a Horizon debit card (subject to terms and conditions). To start the savings account application, simply:\\n- Uninstall the Horizon App\\n- Re‑install the Horizon App from the app store\\n- Submit a savings‑account request through the app\\n\\nPlease note that Singapore‑dollar deposits held by non‑bank depositors are protected by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation up to {{faq_1b9ab045_012}} per depositor across all Scheme members, as mandated by law.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_586ee40c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical time required to complete a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission usually takes only a few minutes.\\n- If further clarification is needed and we must contact you, the process may extend to a maximum of five business days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_357dd970\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical duration for completing a Horizon Bank application?\\n\\nAnswer: - The submission is usually processed within a few minutes.\\n- Should we need to reach out for further clarification, the review period can extend to as long as five business days.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current c