l need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again. Additionally, Singapore-dollar deposits held by non-bank depositors are protected by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation up to S$100,000 per depositor across all Scheme members, as mandated by law.\nUser: how to apply credit card\nAI: To streamline your credit card application with Horizon Bank, Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can utilize MyInfo for expedited form completion. 😊 If you are a foreign applicant, please ensure you have your passport and most recent payslip readily available for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App, in addition to accessing MyInfo.\nUser: how to apply for a loan\nAI: To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, please follow these steps: 😊\n\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process.\n\nIf you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\nUser: what else do you know about aloan\nAI: Horizon Bank's Instant Loan allows you to convert a portion of the available credit on your Horizon credit card into cash. 😊 For current clients, you will need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit. New applicants—including Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals—are also permitted to apply, subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment.\nUser: where can i visit the branch\nAI: You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\nUser: no, any pthyscial branch that i can do transaction?\nAI: You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\nUser: any physical branch for operation?\nAI: You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\nUser: no, that's 