T\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"faq_768b41d9\"], \"reason\": \"The provided parents confirm that a directory of branch locations is available via the Horizon website, which is a relevant starting point for the user's request, though they do not provide the specific physical addresses of branches.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"fact\": \"A directory of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"fact\": \"A list of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON. The Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1b9ab045\", \"content\": \"Question: Why did Horizon Bank reject my credit card application?\\n\\nAnswer: - Every credit card request undergoes an internal review, and we evaluate each submission thoroughly. Typical reasons for a denial include:\\n- Insufficient earnings:\\n  • Singapore citizen or Permanent Resident aged {{faq_1b9ab045_001}}‑{{faq_1b9ab045_002}} with yearly income under {{faq_1b9ab045_003}}\\n  • Singapore citizen or Permanent Resident aged {{faq_1b9ab045_004}}+ with yearly income under {{faq_1b9ab045_005}}\\n  • Non‑resident ({{faq_1b9ab045_006}} years or older) earning less than {{faq_1b9ab045_007}} annually\\n- Having already reached the maximum credit exposure allowed across all banks\\n- Existing overdue obligations with other financial institutions\\n- Absence of a recent Notice of Assessment or CPF contribution record\\n- Applicant is younger than {{faq_1b9ab045_008}} years old\\n\\nIf you were declined, you may still consider opening a Horizon savings account, which offers up to {{faq_1b9ab045_009}} p.a. on the first {{faq_1b9ab045_010}} deposited and can provide up to an {{faq_1b9ab045_011}} return when paired with a Horizon debit card (subject to terms and conditions). To start the savings account application, simply:\\n- Uninstall the Horizon App\\n- Re‑install the Horizon App from the app store\\n- Submit a savings‑account request through the app\\n\\nPlease note that Singapore‑dollar deposits held by non‑bank depositors are protected by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation up to {{faq_1b9ab045_012}} per depositor across all Scheme members, as mandated by law.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I locate my Horizon Bank account number?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Choose the “Savings” section.\\n- Your account number is displayed on the primary account card, following the label “Main –”.\\n- To copy it, tap the primary card and select the copy icon within the “Horizon savings account number” panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n     