 1, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"faq_768b41d9\"], \"reason\": \"The provided parents confirm that a directory of branch locations is available via the Horizon website, which is a relevant starting point for the user's request, though they do not provide the specific physical addresses of branches.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"fact\": \"A directory of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"fact\": \"A list of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_1e61de43\", \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"faq_768b41d9\"], \"reason\": \"The parents provide the location of a Horizon Experience Centre and confirm that a directory of branch locations is available via the Horizon website, which is relevant to the user's request for a physical branch, although they do not provide a comprehensive list of all physical bank branches.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"fact\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre is located at VivoCity #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}} and provides guidance on basic banking tasks.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"fact\": \"A directory of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"fact\": \"A list of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_730ac28e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank safeguard its customers' electronic payment transactions, and what responsibilities do account holders have in protecting their accounts?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we adhere to the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines set forth by the Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS), which outline the roles of both financial institutions and consumers in preventing and addressing unauthorized and erroneous transactions. To ensure the security of your protected account, which includes any account with a balance exceeding {{faq_730ac28e_001}} or equivalent, capable of electronic transactions, and issued by a relevant payment service provider, please follow these best practices: \\n   - Only download the Horizon App from authorized sources and regularly update your browser and operating system.\\n   - Provide accurate contact information and opt-in to receive transaction notifications to stay informed about your account activity.\\n   - Safeguard your One-Time Passwords (OTPs) sent via the Horizon App or SMS, and secure access to your protected account.\\n   - Carefully review risk warning messages and content from Horizon Bank before proceeding with payment transactions or engaging in high-risk activities.\\n   - Verify website addresses and phone numbers through official channels to avoid potential scams.\\n   - Understand the risks associated with high-risk activities and take necessary precautions.\\n   - Promptly report any suspicious or unauthorized activity on your account, and utilize the self-service 'kill switch' feature provided by Horizon Bank to block further access.\\n   - Cooperate with Horizon Bank by providing detailed information about unauthorized transactions and filing a police report if you suspect you've been a victim of fraud or scam.\\n   For comprehensive details on the E-Payment Guidelines, please visit the MAS website at https://www.mas.gov.sg/regulation/guidelines/e-payments-user-protection-guidelines.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ad98a5ba\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the details of Horizon Bank's Signature deposit plan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Signature account provides a maximum annual interest of {{faq_ad98a5ba_001}} on the first {{faq_ad98a5ba_002}} million of your balance, composed of:\\n  • A base rate of {{faq_ad98a5ba_003}} per year, applied without any conditions;\\n  • A spend‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_004}} per year for Horizon Union members (or {{faq_ad98a5ba_005}} for non‑members) when you complete five qualifying {{faq_ad98a5ba_006}} card transactions in a month;\\n  • A balance‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_007}} per year once the account maintains an average daily balance of at least {{faq_ad98a5ba_008}} during the month;\\n  • A salary‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_009}} per year if a single GIRO credit of a minimum of {{faq_ad98a5ba_010}} is posted in the month.\\n- Any portion of the balance that exceeds {{faq_ad98a5ba_011}} million earns only the base rate of {{faq_ad98a5ba_012}} per year.\\n- Interest is credited to the account on the last day of each month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e200634\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the details of Horizon Bank's Signature deposit plan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Signature plan lets you earn up to {{faq_6e200634_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_6e200634_002}} million of your deposit balance. The rate is built from several components:\\n  * A base interest of {{faq_6e200634_003}} p.a. that applies automatically;\\n  * A spend‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_004}} p.a. for NTUC Union members (or {{faq_6e200634_005}} p.a. for non‑members) when you complete five qualifying {{faq_6e200634_006}} card transactions within the month;\\n  * A balance‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_007}} p.a. once your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_6e200634_008}};\\n  * A salary‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_009}} p.a. if you receive a minimum salary credit of {{faq_6e200634_010}} in a single GIRO transaction during the month.\\n- Any portion of the balance that exceeds {{faq_6e200634_011}} million earns interest at the base rate of {{faq_6e200634_012}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_48ced7a5\", \"content\": \"Question: What can I do with a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Bank Savings Account is denominated in Singapore dollars (SGD) and is designed for both saving and routine financial activities.\\n- Store funds in SGD.\\n- Settle everyday purchases in SGD using your Horizon card or a PayNow QR code.\\n- Access cash at any Standard Chartered ATM using the Horizon card.\\n- Send or receive SGD to and from other banks via FAST, PayNow, incoming GIRO, or salary crediting.\\n- Pay off outstanding balances on your Horizon credit card either through scheduled autopay or one‑time payments.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON. The Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual cl