le through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 3, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"faq_768b41d9\", \"faq_1e61de43\"], \"reason\": \"The parents confirm that a directory of branch locations is available via the Horizon website and provide the location of the Horizon Experience Centre, which is relevant to the user's request for a physical branch, although they do not provide a comprehensive list of all physical bank branches.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"fact\": \"A directory of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"fact\": \"A list of branch locations is accessible through the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"fact\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre is located at VivoCity #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}} and provides guidance on basic banking tasks.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8d322d06\", \"content\": \"Question: What range of financial products and services does Horizon Bank provide to its customers?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank is pleased to introduce an initial suite of products, including a Horizon credit card, a savings account, and personal accident insurance for families. These offerings are complemented by a best-in-class rewards and loyalty program, seamlessly integrated with the FairPrice Group ecosystem. Furthermore, Horizon Bank has collaborated with prominent brands such as KFC, Starbucks, Viu, and Caltex to bring exclusive deals, providing our customers with additional savings opportunities. This marks the beginning of our product development journey, and we look forward to working closely with our customers to further enhance and expand our offerings.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_02489175\", \"content\": \"Question: What information will be displayed when I initiate a payment to a recipient through Horizon Bank's digital banking services?\\n\\nAnswer: When sending funds to an individual recipient, you will notice that only a portion of their name is visible after entering their PayNow proxy. However, for corporate recipients, the full registered company name will be displayed as usual. This applies to all PayNow transactions, including those made using the Scan to Pay feature within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_173fbcd8\", \"content\": \"Question: Can you describe the premium banking offering provided by Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank's elevated banking experience is designed to facilitate effortless savings growth through transparency and simplicity. By maintaining a minimum of {{faq_173fbcd8_001}}K in eligible balances across your Horizon Bank savings account Average Daily Balance (ADB) and/or Horizon Invest account value, you will automatically qualify for this exclusive program the following month. As a valued member, you can look forward to enjoying a range of privileges, including {{faq_173fbcd8_002}}-for-{{faq_173fbcd8_003}} exclusive offers, a premium metal Horizon card, an enhanced Horizon App experience, and priority customer support directly within the app.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_768b41d9\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate an ATM to take out cash?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank cardholders may withdraw funds from any Horizon‑branded or Standard Chartered (SCB) ATM throughout Singapore, as well as from Visa‑compatible ATMs overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_768b41d9_001}}‑{{faq_768b41d9_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre and Battery Road.\\n- A full list of locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your 