{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T09:23:13.762+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ed3552d4-3e2a-4340-89be-de5e66f2ddbb", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): can you give me the contact number?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: you only have this one real branch, right?\nAI: Horizon Bank does not operate a traditional bank branch 🏦. However, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B2-23. Our knowledgeable representatives are available there to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries ✨.\nUser: can you give me the contact number?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Visit the Horizon Experience Centre at VivoCity to speak with a representative for assistance.\", \"policy\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre provides guidance on app navigation and general banking queries only.\", \"conceptual\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre is a physical location for customers to receive in-person support.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the contact phone number for the Horizon Experience Centre at VivoCity.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the contact phone number for the Horizon Experience Centre at VivoCity.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Visit the Horizon Experience Centre at VivoCity to speak with a representative for assistance.\", \"policy\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre provides guidance on app navigation and general banking queries only.\", \"conceptual\": \"The Horizon Experience Centre is a physical location for customers to receive in-person support.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON. The Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_76c34cea\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it required to book an appointment before visiting the Horizon Experience Centre for in‑person identity verification?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you submitted a manual application before {{faq_76c34cea_001}} December {{faq_76c34cea_002}}, you may attend without scheduling an appointment.\\n- From {{faq_76c34cea_003}} December {{faq_76c34cea_004}} onward, we recommend completing the application via MyInfo authentication, which is faster and more secure. Ensure your SingPass details are current before you apply.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5b37494f\", \"content\": \"Question: What should I prepare and bring when I visit a Horizon Bank Experience Centre?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you filed a paper application before {{faq_5b37494f_001}} Dec {{faq_5b37494f_002}} and did not use MyInfo, you must appear at a Horizon Bank Experience Centre for in‑person identity verification. Bring the original identification documents:\\n  • NRIC for Singapore citizens or permanent residents.\\n  • Passport for Work Pass or Dependent Pass holders.\\n- A Horizon representative will confirm your identity and continue processing your request.\\n- You can monitor the application’s progress through the Horizon App.\\n- From {{faq_5b37494f_003}} Dec {{faq_5b37494f_004}} onward, we advise using MyInfo authentication for a faster, more secure submission. Ensure your SingPass details are up‑to‑date before applying.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual proposition directly relevant to a\n          meaningful aspect of the customer's resolved request. If one does,\n          do not return INSUFFICIENT merely because the parent cannot determine\n          the customer's requested outcome, permission, eligibility,\n          exception, legality, preferred action, or other broader conclusion.\n          Retain that parent as PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when its supported fact\n          can be truthfully presented as useful, bounded Horizon guidance\n          while another material aspect remains unresolved. Continue retrieval\n          for the unresolved aspect.\n        - Return