{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T10:21:39.619+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_ed3552d4-3e2a-4340-89be-de5e66f2ddbb", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): any documents required?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: you only have this one real branch, right?\nAI: Horizon Bank does not operate a traditional bank branch 🏦. However, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B2-23. Our knowledgeable representatives are available there to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries ✨.\nUser: can you give me the contact number?\nAI: You can reach the Horizon Experience Centre at VivoCity by calling +65 313-HORIZON 📞. Alternatively, if you need assistance with your account, you can also reach out through the in-app chat ✨.\nUser: how to apply for a loan\nAI: To apply for an Instant Loan with Horizon Bank ✨, here are the steps and criteria depending on your customer status:\n\nThe application process varies slightly depending on whether you are currently a Horizon Bank client or a new applicant.\n\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process. You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit.\n\nSingapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply. Download the Horizon App, navigate to Product Selection, and choose Instant Loan to begin. Every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\n\nAdditionally, you may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\n- You are aged between 21 and 65 years.\n- Your annual income is at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\n- Your annual income is at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\nUser: what's the requirment for opening a stock account\nAI: To start buying and selling securities with Horizon Bank, you will need to set up a securities trading account 📈. To do this, simply open the Horizon App, navigate to the Investments section, and select the Stocks feature. From there, just follow the prompts on your screen to complete the setup process ✨. Please note that opening this account is subject to an internal review by Horizon Bank.\n\nTo be eligible to open a Stocks account, you must have an active Savings account with us (which you can easily open through the app if you haven't already) and be between 18 and 74 years of age. Please keep in mind that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account.\nUser: any documents required?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to the investments section in the app and follow the prompts to submit identification documents.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must be between 18 and 74 years old and hold an active savings account with us.\", \"conceptual\": \"A securities trading account allows individual customers to buy and sell stocks through the Horizon mobile application.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Stocks\", \"Deposit_Account\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Wealth And Insurance\", \"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"What documents are required to open a stock trading account with Horizon Bank?\", \"direct_query\": \"What documents are required to open a stock trading account with Horizon Bank?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to the investments section in the app and follow the prompts to submit identification documents.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must be between 18 and 74 years old and hold an active savings account with us.\", \"conceptual\": \"A securities trading account allows individual customers to buy and sell stocks through the Horizon mobile application.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents describe the eligibility criteria and the process for initiating a Stocks account setup, but they do not contain any information regarding the specific documents required to complete the application.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_e94ad933\", \"fact\": \"Eligibility for a Stocks account requires an active Savings account and being between the ages of {{faq_e94ad933_001}} and {{faq_e94ad933_002}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_502da680\", \"fact\": \"Opening a securities trading account involves navigating to the Investments section in the Horizon App and following on-screen prompts.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss investment opportunities, security risks, minimum investment thresholds, and payment methods (cash only), but none of these address the specific documentation required to open a stock trading account.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c8d61dc6\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank stock trading services include stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges and UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4bd34aa4\", \"fact\": \"The minimum investment threshold for purchasing stocks and ETFs is USD {{faq_4bd34aa4_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b6934e37\", \"fact\": \"Investment activities at Horizon Bank are limited to cash transactions and do not support CPF or SRS accounts.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_10f9fec0\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the requirements to open a new Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: To initiate the application process for a Horizon Bank account, simply utilize your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo, which will expedite the pre-filling of your application in a secure manner. For non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation, particularly if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1e61de43\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I find a physical location to learn more about Horizon Bank's services and get assistance with the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B{{faq_1e61de43_001}}-{{faq_1e61de43_002}}. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. Please note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +{{faq_1e61de43_003}} {{faq_1e61de43_004}}-HORIZON. The Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from {{faq_1e61de43_005}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_006}}pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from {{faq_1e61de43_007}}am to {{faq_1e61de43_008}}pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6d8abb4a\", \"content\": \"Question: Where are the ATMs I can use to withdraw cash with my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - You may obtain cash at any Horizon‑branded ATM or at Standard Chartered Bank (SCB) ATMs that accept Visa, both within the country and overseas.\\n- Horizon‑branded machines are situated at FairPrice Xtra Vivocity, unit B{{faq_6d8abb4a_001}}‑{{faq_6d8abb4a_002}}.\\n- SCB ATMs are available at Bedok Mall, Bugis Junction, Vivocity, Sixth Avenue, Clementi Mall, NEX Serangoon, Serangoon Garden, Marine Parade, Changi Business Park, Tampines, Marina Bay Financial Centre, and Battery Road.\\n- A full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts f