zon App to secure ATM transactions.\\n  * Number‑less design: The card’s number is stored securely in the Horizon App, reducing the risk of theft or fraud.\\n- Convenient cash access: Withdraw funds at Horizon Bank’s ATM inside FairPrice Xtra VivoCity or at any Standard Chartered ATM nationwide.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d158d0e5\", \"content\": \"Question: What advantages and functionalities does Horizon Bank's savings account provide?\\n\\nAnswer: - Tailored savings plans that let you earn interest on your deposits, with a rate of up to {{faq_d158d0e5_001}} on the first {{faq_d158d0e5_002}} and {{faq_d158d0e5_003}} p.a. on any amount above that threshold.\\n- Completely fee‑free: no hidden charges, no minimum‑balance penalties, no monthly service fee, no account‑closure fee, no foreign‑exchange fee, and no annual debit‑card fee.\\n- Your own Horizon debit card, offering:\\n  * Instant virtual card: receive a digital card instantly via the Horizon App for online purchases before the physical card arrives.\\n  * Physical card activation via NFC or activation code: tap the card to the back of an NFC‑enabled phone for automatic activation, or use the code provided in your welcome pack if your phone lacks NFC.\\n  * PIN configuration: set a six‑digit PIN within the Horizon App to securely conduct ATM transactions.\\n  * Numberless design: the card number is hidden to protect against theft and fraud, and can be viewed anytime in the Horizon App.\\n- Easy cash access: withdraw funds from your savings account at Horizon’s ATM inside FairPrice Xtra VivoCity or at any Standard Chartered ATM.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_70aebcd6\", \"content\": \"Question: What information and tools are necessary to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you