{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T10:51:52.076+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_12e9c6eb-f5ba-4990-946a-58f1baa37169", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 11 pending requests (Change Address, Resubmit KYC Document, and Replace Card) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\\n\\nWould you like to continue with your address change request?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To begin trading securities in the Horizon App, you can establish a securities trading account by navigating to the app, selecting the Investments option, and choosing the Stocks feature 📱. From there, simply follow the on-screen prompts to complete the setup process. Please note that account approval depends on an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank 📈.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"can i apply credit card after rejection\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I currently do not have any details available regarding eligibility to re-apply for a credit card after a previous application was not approved. 💳\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"really, can you try harder?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"If your Instant Loan request is declined, that decision does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank products, such as a credit card or a savings account. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain. 💳\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to apply credit card\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To streamline your credit card application with Horizon Bank, Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can utilize MyInfo for expedited form completion. 😊 If you are a foreign applicant, please ensure you have your passport and most recent payslip readily available for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App, in addition to accessing MyInfo.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to apply for a loan\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, please follow these steps: 😊\\n\\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process.\\n\\nIf you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what else do you know about aloan\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Horizon Bank's Instant Loan allows you to convert a portion of the available credit on your Horizon credit card into cash. 😊 For current clients, you will need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit. New applicants—including Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals—are also permitted to apply, subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"where can i visit the branch\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"no, any pthyscial branch that i can do transaction?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"any physical branch for operation?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"You can access a full directory of ATM and branch locations by visiting the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"no, that's not what i am asking, i need real bank branch\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To answer your question regarding physical locations, a full directory of ATM and branch locations can be accessed via the ATM/Branch Locator on the Horizon website. 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"you find it for me\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B2-23. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. 😊\\n\\nPlease note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +65 313-HORIZON.\\n\\nThe Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from 11am to 7pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from 11am to 3pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"you only have this one real branch, right?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"For those interested in exploring Horizon Bank's offerings, our Horizon Experience Centre is conveniently situated within FairPrice Xtra in VivoCity at #B2-23. Our knowledgeable representatives are available to provide guidance on navigating the Horizon App, performing basic banking tasks, and answering general queries. 😊\\n\\nPlease note that this centre does not operate as a traditional bank branch, and certain account-specific services, such as updating personal details, resolving transaction disputes, and checking voucher redemption status, cannot be facilitated on-site. If you require assistance with your account, we invite you to reach out to us through the in-app chat or by calling +65 313-HORIZON.\\n\\nThe Horizon Experience Centre is open daily from 11am to 7pm, with reduced hours on Christmas Eve, New Year's Eve, and Chinese New Year's Eve from 11am to 3pm. The centre is closed on Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and Chinese New Year public holidays.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If there is no unresolved topic, or the transcript is empty, return an\n      empty string -- an empty follow-up is the normal, expected outcome for\n      most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
