{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T16:07:51.691+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_0f30b08a-fdf7-4961-90f1-3c566cec5ec5", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Last Session Transcript):\n    {\"last_session_transcript\": [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 9 pending requests (Change Address, Resubmit KYC Document, and Replace Card) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Check my account balance\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I don't currently have access to information regarding checking your account balance 💳.\"}]}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    Would you like to continue checking your account balance?\n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n  exceed that value. It does not, by itself, support claims about applications,\n  approvals, denials, exceptions, or who controls the limit.\n\n\n    TASK: Assess EVIDENCE GROUNDEDNESS ONLY. Do not assess conduct, tone,\n    regulatory compliance, or completeness — a separate auditor handles those.\n    Every factual claim, instruction, figure, or suggestion in the Customer-Facing\n    Content must be directly supported by the Permitted Evidence above; nothing\n    outside it may be used as a factual source.\n\n    \n    This is a login follow-up, not an answer to a customer question. It is\n    grounded only if every claim about \"what happened last time\" is directly\n    supported by \"last_session_transcript\". It must not state or imply that\n    anything is being executed, attached, or completed by this message\n    itself -- it may only ask whether the customer wants to continue.\n    Reject it if it describes an unresolved topic not actually visible in\n    the transcript, or claims the last session concluded differently than\n    the transcript shows.\n    \n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"evidence_violations\": [{\"scope\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"], \"evidence_gap\": \"...\"}]}\n    "}
