s account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2109a75e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank calculate the monthly payment for my loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The monthly payment is computed by summing the approved principal amount with the total interest that will accrue over the loan term, and then dividing that combined figure by the total number of months in the loan period. For additional details, please consult the Horizon Instant Loan Terms & Conditions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8984208c\", \"content\": \"Question: What charges does Horizon Bank apply to an Instant Loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - No annual fee is levied on Instant Loans that were originated before {{faq_8984208c_001}} February {{faq_8984208c_002}}.\\n- For Instant Loans opened on or after {{faq_8984208c_003}} February {{faq_8984208c_004}}:\\n  * A first‑year annual charge equal to {{faq_8984208c_005}} % of the loan amount is added to your Horizon credit card.\\n  * If the loan term is one year or longer, a {{faq_8984208c_006}} anniversary fee is assessed each year the loan remains outstanding, but only when the minimum payment on your Horizon credit card has not been received by its due date for the preceding {{faq_8984208c_007}} consecutive calendar months.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money