{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T16:11:45.448+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_0f30b08a-fdf7-4961-90f1-3c566cec5ec5", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to apply for a loan, what should i do? any doc required? also i lost my credit card. can i replace it?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 8 pending requests (Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue checking your account balance?\nUser: Check my account balance\nAI: I currently do not have information available regarding how to check your account balance 💳.\nUser: Recent transactions\nAI: You can view and download your past monthly statements by using the View Statements button below.\nUser: when do i need to repay the loan?\nAI: Your loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement 💳. If an installment is not fully settled by the scheduled due date, the remaining principal will accrue interest at a daily rate of 0.077% (equivalent to 27.9% per annum) until Horizon Bank receives the payment. To manage this in the app, open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\nUser: how to open an account\nAI: To start a savings account application with Horizon Bank, you can follow these steps:\n- Uninstall the Horizon App\n- Re-install the Horizon App from the app store\n- Submit a savings-account request through the app\n\nAdditionally, opening a savings account requires a mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form 📱.\nUser: i want to apply for a loan, what should i do? any doc required? also i lost my credit card. can i replace it?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Submit application through the mobile app, upload required identification documents, complete the digital verification process\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements, provide proof of income, and maintain valid identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides funds for personal expenses, repaid in monthly installments over a fixed term\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to apply for a loan and what documents are required\", \"direct_query\": \"How to apply for a loan and what documents are required\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit application through the mobile app, upload required identification documents, complete the digital verification process\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements, provide proof of income, and maintain valid identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides funds for personal expenses, repaid in monthly installments over a fixed term\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_02ad328e\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the consequences if I fail to pay the entire loan installment by the due date?\\n\\nAnswer: - If the installment is not fully settled by the scheduled due date, the remaining principal will accrue interest at a daily rate of {{faq_02ad328e_001}} (equivalent to {{faq_02ad328e_002}} per annum) until Horizon Bank receives the payment. *Effective {{faq_02ad328e_003}} July {{faq_02ad328e_004}}, Horizon Bank will personalize the credit‑card Effective Interest Rate according to each customer’s credit behaviour, with rates ranging from {{faq_02ad328e_005}} to {{faq_02ad328e_006}} per annum.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Report the card as lost via the mobile app, confirm delivery address, and activate the replacement card\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued upon reporting loss, subject to standard delivery timelines and potential replacement fees\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement is a security measure to prevent unauthorized transactions after a card is reported lost\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to replace a lost credit card\", \"direct_query\": \"How to replace a lost credit card\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Report the card as lost via the mobile app, confirm delivery address, and activate the replacement card\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued upon reporting loss, subject to standard delivery timelines and potential replacement fees\", \"conceptual\": \"Card replacement is a security measure to prevent unauthorized transactions after a card is reported lost\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_74392fe2\", \"content\": \"Question: I've applied for a new Horizon card, but it hasn't arrived yet. What steps can I take to resolve the issue?\\n\\nAnswer: To address the non-receipt of your replacement Horizon card, please get in touch with our dedicated support team through the following channels: \\n    * Utilize the live chat feature or initiate a voice call directly from your Horizon App \\n    * Alternatively, you can reach us by dialing +{{faq_74392fe2_001}} {{faq_74392fe2_002}}-HORIZON\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query fo