ld i do? any doc required? also i lost my credit card. can i replace it?\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"element_1\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_1\"]}, {\"block_id\": \"element_2\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_2\"]}]\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"How to apply for a loan and what documents are required\", \"resolution_status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\"}]\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        No-Info Inputs (the only source for an unavailable-information statement):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, you can follow these steps through the Horizon App 📱:\n\nNavigate to the Money menu.\n\nChoose Loan to initiate the process. If you are not yet a Horizon customer, download the Horizon App first, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\n\nFor current Horizon Bank clients, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit. For new applicants, Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan, and every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment. You may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\n\nIf your Horizon card is missing, you can take these steps to manage and replace it:\n\n