{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T16:39:24.818+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_2a6a38fe-1cbd-464b-966d-ed27e84b490f", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 8 pending requests (Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\\n\\nWould you like to continue checking your account balance?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Check my account balance\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I currently do not have information available regarding how to check your account balance 💳.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Recent transactions\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"You can view and download your past monthly statements by using the View Statements button below.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"when do i need to repay the loan?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Your loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement 💳. If an installment is not fully settled by the scheduled due date, the remaining principal will accrue interest at a daily rate of 0.077% (equivalent to 27.9% per annum) until Horizon Bank receives the payment. To manage this in the app, open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to open an account\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To start a savings account application with Horizon Bank, you can follow these steps:\\n- Uninstall the Horizon App\\n- Re-install the Horizon App from the app store\\n- Submit a savings-account request through the app\\n\\nAdditionally, opening a savings account requires a mobile phone together with MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form 📱.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i want to apply for a loan, what should i do? any doc required? also i lost my credit card. can i replace it?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, you can follow these steps through the Horizon App 📱:\\n\\nNavigate to the Money menu.\\n\\nChoose Loan to initiate the process. If you are not yet a Horizon customer, download the Horizon App first, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\\n\\nFor current Horizon Bank clients, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit. For new applicants, Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan, and every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment. You may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between 21 and 65 years.\\n- Your annual income is at least S$30,000 if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least S$60,000 if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\\n\\nIf your Horizon card is missing, you can take these steps to manage and replace it:\\n\\nSign in to the Horizon App, tap \\\"View & Manage Card\\\" on the card overview screen, and select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n\\nOpen the card dashboard, choose \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n\\nYou may also wish to file a police report. The new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments (such as subscriptions) with the new details. For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i am 19, can i apply for loan?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank, you must be aged between 21 and 65 years old 💳.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"can i open an aacount then?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"At present, Horizon Bank does not permit account applications from outside Singapore. You must be a Singapore resident and submit the request locally 💳.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i mean can i open an account at the age of 19? i'm not asking if i can apply outside of singapore\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"You must be 16 years old or older to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank 💳.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If there is no unresolved topic, or the transcript is empty, return an\n      empty string -- an empty follow-up is the normal, expected outcome for\n      most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
