{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T18:20:06.571+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_98dca89b-0d1b-4090-8a1e-ebc208020185", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 7 pending requests (Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Check my account balance\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I do not currently have the necessary details available to check your account balance 💳.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i want to apply for a loan, what should i do? any doc required? also i lost my credit card. can i replace it?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To apply for an Instant Loan as a current Horizon Bank client, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit 💳. New applicants, including Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals, are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment. You may request a credit facility if you are aged between 21 and 65 years, and have an annual income of at least S$30,000 (for Singapore citizens and permanent residents) or at least S$60,000 (for foreigners holding a valid work pass).\\n\\nLog into the Horizon App, open the card dashboard, choose \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" 💳.\\n\\nTap \\\"Order Replacement\\\" after freezing your card. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to apply for a loan\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To apply for an Instant Loan as a current Horizon Bank client, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit 💳. New applicants, including Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals, are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment. You may request a credit facility if you are aged between 21 and 65 years, and have an annual income of at least S$30,000 (for Singapore citizens and permanent residents) or at least S$60,000 (for foreigners holding a valid work pass).\\n\\nYou can follow these steps in the Horizon App to submit your loan application 💳.\\n\\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process.\\n\\nIf you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to Product Selection and choose Instant Loan to begin your application.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If there is no unresolved topic, or the transcript is empty, return an\n      empty string -- an empty follow-up is the normal, expected outcome for\n      most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
