"customer_component\":\"business credit card annual fee\",\"resolution\":\"DECLINE\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":null,\"decline\":{\"reason\":\"This assistant's information covers individual credit cards only, not business credit cards.\",\"category\":\"individual_customers_only\"}}]}\n    \n    "}
