{"timestamp": "2026-08-29T04:38:39.471+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_22529400-17f3-4612-88a1-4327ce45b0aa", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): I am asking about the fees for a credit card.\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 6 pending requests (Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\n\nWould you like to continue clarifying the rates and fees for our banking products from your last session?\nUser: what's the rate?\nAI: Could you please clarify what you mean when you refer to banking products 💳? For instance, are you asking about a credit card, a deposit account, or a personal loan?\nUser: what are the fees? and can i apply for a card?\nAI: You can apply for a card directly using the Manage Card navigation button below. Regarding your question about fees, please clarify which specific banking products, such as credit cards, deposit accounts, or personal loans, you would like to know about.\n\nCould you clarify what you mean by \"banking products\"?\nUser: I am asking about the fees for a credit card.\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"