uinely inferable (e.g. an unresolved term with only one plausible matrix match given the customer's wording); leave it empty when you have no real basis to guess (e.g. a term identifying no plausible product or intent at all). Each entry needs a short \"label\" (e.g. \"Personal Loan\"), a \"message\" that is a complete, natural sentence a customer would actually send (e.g. \"I'm asking about a personal loan.\") -- never a bare word or phrase as the message -- and a \"reason\": a concise, internal-only justification naming the specific Matrix fact or conversation detail that makes this guess plausible (e.g. \"Personal_Loan is the only loan-type Matrix product\" or \"customer named credit cards two turns ago\"). A guess you cannot state a concrete reason for is not genuinely inferable -- do not offer it; this is not a customer-facing field, but writing it forces the same discipline as populating candidate_replies at all.\n    7. SCOPE DECLINE: For a DECLINE component, set decline.reason to a short, factual internal statement and decline.category per Rule 3's two cases. For category=\"out_of_scope_product\", only decline when the matrix confirms no matching BASE product family exists at all — never guess, and never decline merely because a qualified or branded variant of an existing base product is unfamiliar. For category=\"individual_customers_only\", name the non-individual segment (e.g., business, corporate) in decline.reason without asserting whether Horizon does or does not serve that segment in reality — only that this assistant's information does not cover it. The customer-facing decline sentence itself is generated deterministically downstream from decline.category -- do not draft one here.\n    8. Use \"ALL\" only when a component is genuinely universal and its Intent is a valid intent listed under \"ALL\" in the Product/Intent Matrix. \"ALL\" is not a fallback for an unknown product.\n\n    Output JSON ONLY:\n    {\"components\": [{\"component_id\":\"component_1\",\"customer_component\":\"open an account\",\"resolution\":\"SEARCH\",\"search_task\":{\"task_id\":\"task_1\",\"angle_groups\":[{\"group_id\":\"base\",\"procedural\":\"...\",\"policy\":\"...\",\"conceptual\":\"...\"}],\"target_commercial_product\":\"Deposit_Account\",\"target_intent\":[\"Application\"]},\"clarification\":null,\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_2\",\"customer_component\":\"the fee\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_1\",\"unresolved_request\":\"the fee\",\"reason\":\"No product or service is identified.\",\"candidate_replies\":[]},\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_5\",\"customer_component\":\"how to apply for a loan\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_2\",\"unresolved_request\":\"loan\",\"reason\":\"Personal_Loan is the only loan-type matrix product, but the customer's intended type is not confirmed.\",\"candidate_replies\":[{\"label\":\"Personal Loan\",\"message\":\"I'm asking about a personal loan.\",\"reason\":\"Personal_Loan is the only loan-type Matrix product.\"}]},\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_6\",\"customer_component\":\"I have a question about my loan\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_3\",\"unresolved_request\":\"a question about my loan\",\"reason\":\"Product (Personal_Loan) is unambiguous, but no verb, action, or outcome is given -- Application, Repayment, and Eligibility are all equally plausible intents with no basis to prefer one.\",\"candidate_replies\":[{\"label\":\"Applying\",\"message\":\"I want to know how to apply for a loan.\",\"reason\":\"Application is a valid Matrix intent for Personal_Loan.\"},{\"label\":\"Repayment\",\"message\":\"I want to know about repaying my loan.\",\"reason\":\"Repayment is a valid Matrix intent for Personal_Loan.\"},{\"lab