{"timestamp": "2026-08-29T05:32:55.944+00:00", "event": "llm.response", "session_id": "verify4-1787981560", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_response": "{\n  \"elements\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_1\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"When looking at personal loan eligibility with Horizon Bank, the requirements depend on whether you are an existing client or a new applicant 😊.\\n\\nFor current Horizon Bank clients, you need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n\\nFor new applicants, Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan. Every submission is subject to Horizon Bank’s credit-worthiness assessment. Additionally, you need to satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You must be aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income must be at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income must be at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_2\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Regarding credit card fee structures and related processes at Horizon Bank:\\n- To request a waiver of a late payment fee, you can send a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service, specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. The team will review your request and provide an update via push notification within {{faq_25ce7c68_001}} working days.\\n- If you miss a payment on multiple Horizon Bank credit cards, a consolidated statement is provided for all your cards, and you will be charged a single late fee applied across all your cards rather than separate fees for each individual card.\\n- Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional supplementary card. All expenses incurred on the supplementary card are combined with the primary card’s balance, and any late-payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clarification\": \"\"\n}", "elapsed_ms": 2488.03}
